    "description": {
      "content": "The 3scale Analytics API provides access to API usage data, traffic metrics, hit counts, and reporting for APIs managed through the 3scale platform. It enables operators to retrieve usage statistics, query by time period and granularity, and integrate analytics data into external dashboards.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Red Hat 3scale Support",
